'''Hoopa's Surprise Ring Adventures''' (Japanese: '''フーパのおでまし大作戦！！''' ''Hoopa's Appear Plan!!'') are a series of six {{pkmn|animation|animated}} shorts for ''[[Pokémon the Series: XY]]'', leading up to the release of ''[[M18|Hoopa and the Clash of Ages]]''. They star [[Ash Ketchum]] and his {{AP|Pikachu}} as they get in trouble started by the [[Mythical Pokémon]] {{an|Hoopa}}. 

The shorts originally aired weekly on [[Oha Suta]] from April 23, 2015 to May 28, 2015. The English [[dub]]bed versions of all six shorts were available on [[Pokémon.com]] starting on December 11, 2015. The shorts were later made available in English, {{pmin|France|French}}, {{pmin|Germany|German}}, {{pmin|Italy|Italian}}, and {{pmin|Spain|Spanish}} in the Pokémon Theater in the [[Camp Pokémon]] app.

