=== ''Flying in the Air'' ===
[[File:Hoopa Surprise Ring Adventures short 1.png|thumb|250px|Screenshot from ''Flying in the Air'']]
'''Flying in the Air''' (Japanese: '''そらをとぶ''' ''Fly'') is the first animated short. It first aired in Japan on April 23, 2015 and in the United States on December 11, 2015.

==== Summary ====
{{Ash}}, clad in {{tc|Sky Trainer}} wear, decides to do some {{pkmn|training}} but complains about the lack of wind. {{an|Hoopa}} creates portals summoning all kinds of {{type|Flying}} {{OBP|Pokémon|species}}, including the {{pkmn2|Legendary}} {{p|Tornadus}}. They all use {{m|Gust}}, but it turns out to be too much for Ash, {{AP|Pikachu}} and Hoopa and they're sent blasting off.

