===''Shooting Star''===
[[File:Hoopa Surprise Ring Adventures short 5.png|thumb|250px|Screenshot from ''Shooting Star'']]
'''Shooting Star''' (Japanese: '''ながれぼし''' ''Shooting Star'') is the fifth animated short. It first aired in Japan on May 21, 2015 and in the United States on December 11, 2015.

====Summary====
{{Ash}} and {{AP|Pikachu}} are looking at a sky full of stars and suddenly a shooting star flies by. Next, {{an|Hoopa}} appears and makes a whole bunch of shooting stars appear. Ash makes a wish, but as he does so, a {{p|Staryu}} crashes down on him and Pikachu and sends them flying. Hoopa starts laughing but then gets blasted off by another Staryu.

====Characters====
=====Humans=====
* {{Ash}}

=====Pokémon=====
* {{p|Pikachu}} ({{OP|Ash|Pikachu}})
* {{p|Hoopa}} ({{an|Hoopa|anime}})
* {{p|Staryu}} (×2)

===''In the Dark''===
[[File:Hoopa Surprise Ring Adventures short 6.png|thumb|250px|Screenshot from ''In the Dark'']]
'''In the Dark''' (Japanese: '''くらやみ''' ''Darkness'') is the sixth animated short. It first aired in Japan on May 28, 2015 and in the United States on December 11, 2015.

====Summary====
{{Ash}} and {{AP|Pikachu}} are walking through a dark cave. Suddenly, {{an|Hoopa}} shows up and lights up the cave by summoning multiple {{p|Litwick}}. Because Ash appreciates this, Hoopa starts summoning more Litwick. Their light is so bright however that it wakes up nearby {{p|Noibat}}, {{p|Noivern}}, {{p|Carbink}} and {{p|Sableye}}. Ash, Pikachu and Hoopa start running as they are chased by the angry cave inhabitants and are finally blown away by the Pokémon's combined attacks.

